  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-defi-yields",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：DeFi收益分析服务\n\n一个为AI代理提供DeFi收益机会探索和分析的MCP服务器，支持从DefiLlama获取收益池数据并进行关键指标分析。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **get_yield_pools** — \nFetch DeFi yield pools from the yields.llama.fi API, optionally filtering by chain or project.\nReturns symbol, project, tvlUsd, apy, apyMean30d, and predictions for each pool.\n\nArgs:\n    chain: Optional filter for blockchain (e.g., 'Ethereum', 'Solana')\n    project: Optional filter for project name (e.g., 'lido', 'aave-v3')"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-defi-yields\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-defi-yields\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
